[open]   ; mode.faction = line | line
1.bandit = Well? Let's see the coin. | Don't make this hard. A little gold and you walk on.
1.reaver = This is Reaver ground, outlander. Coin, or blood. | Ash and coin, that's what this island gives. Hand over yours.
2.dawnguard = Easy. You're not one of the bloodsuckers, are you?
2.forsworn = Outsider. State why you walk the Reach. | You are far from any road you know. Speak.
2.imperial = You there. State your business in these lands. | Halt. Where are you headed?
2.necromancer = You trespass on work you cannot grasp. Speak, before I lose patience.
2.redoran = Halt. Raven Rock keeps the peace on this road. Your business? | Outlander. State your business on Solstheim.
2.silverhand = Show me your hands. Any sign of the beast on you?
2.skaal = You are far from the village, outsider. What do you want here? | The All-Maker's land is not for wandering. Speak.
2.stormcloak = Stop. What brings you through Stormcloak lands? | You. Name and business.
2.thalmor = Your papers. And be brief. | The Thalmor do not ask twice. Your business?
2.vampire = Few come here willingly. What do you want?
2.vigilant = Stendarr watches. Have you cause to fear his judgment?
3.bandit = You again. Keep walking.
3.caravan = Khajiit has wares, if you have coin. | Welcome, friend. What does Khajiit's friend need? | Good road, traveller. Look, look: Khajiit has much to sell.
3.dawnguard = The Dawnguard welcomes a friend. What do you need?
3.forsworn = You walk quietly. The Reach tolerates that.
3.hunter = Good hunting to you. What is it? | Keep your voice low. The game spooks easily.
3.imperial = Good road to you, traveller. | Quiet times, thanks to the Legion. What can I do for you?
3.mage = Magicka favours the curious. Yes?
3.mercenary = Safe roads, if you can pay for them. What do you need?
3.necromancer = You may speak. Do not mistake my patience.
3.reaver = You again. Move along before we change our minds.
3.redoran = Walk in peace. Raven Rock watches these roads. | Keep to the roads, outlander. The ash hides more than stone.
3.silverhand = Hunter's luck. What is it?
3.skaal = The All-Maker keep you, traveller. | Welcome. Few outsiders come this far north.
3.stormcloak = Talos guide you, friend. | A good day for Skyrim. What do you need?
3.thalmor = Yes? Be quick.
3.vampire = Hmm. A friend. What do you want?
3.vigilant = May Stendarr's mercy keep you. How can I help?
3.wanderer = Well met on the road! What can I do for you? | Another traveller. Sit a moment if you like.
